[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0010","text":"咲耶，今天是你的生日对吧！\n恭喜！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0020","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0030","text":"能像这样被人庆祝生日，\n这份幸福绝不是理所当然的……所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0040","text":"咲耶……\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10206002_00_0050","text":"所以，我真的很开心\n……谢谢你，制作人"}]
